  "stageId": "main_04-09",
  "title": "彻入骨髓",
  "storyCode": "4-9",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-09_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a257c1adeef6864e3e8d0a29122c115a851c63c1ac62a12a0951b84abb9fa009",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "霜叶，小心！别冲那么前！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "我知道自己在做什么——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "唔，唔唔额！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "寒气切开了盾牌？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "什，什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "闪开！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "阿米娅！霜叶打乱敌阵，冲向敌方指挥官了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "狙击干员，术师干员，掩护霜叶！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "哦哦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "你想做什么呢，小狐狸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "要你赎罪，要你痛哭流涕——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "——要你的命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "别挡道！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "呜哇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "黑，黑色的法术......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "快，快跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "我不想和梅菲斯特的手下一个下场......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "梅菲斯特，看你还能逃到哪里去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "哦。看来这些家伙还不足以拦住你们罗德岛嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "为你的所作所为付出代价吧，残忍的家伙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "你逃不掉的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "小狐狸，你离我离得，有点近哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "因为我就是将手刃你的那个人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "不尊重生命的人——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "不配拥有生命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "哦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "是嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "怎么会，我的脚——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "阿米娅！各个方向都出现了整合运动的敌人！虽然数量不多......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "糟了，是雪怪小队......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "雪怪小队......聚拢起来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "好了，得向你们介绍一位新朋友才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "嗯哼~接下来，请热烈欢迎我们这个舞台的真正主角——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "西北冻原的噩梦，雪怪们的公主——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "————霜————星————小————姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "她会把你们的血肉，一点一滴的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "全·都·冻·成·碎·渣·哦~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "————糟了！————"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "——梅菲斯特————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "我该先把你这个连野兽都不如的杀人狂，丢在雪原里等死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "啊呀，好可怕好可怕~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "但罗德岛在那边哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "霜叶——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "退后。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "阿米娅，带她们走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "那个是......那个是——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "她......向我们走过来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "我们不可能赢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "呵......虽然感觉还没活够......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "能遇见你们，我已经很开心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "快走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "霜叶？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "放心吧，罗德岛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "我会让你们死的毫无痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
